{# Visitor counter. One script, no libraries, no cookies, on every served page.
   It records a view per page load and fills any [data-counter] element with
   the number. If it is unreachable it catches its own errors and the page is
   unaffected.

   defer, not async: the script fills the counter elements as soon as it runs,
   so it has to run after the document is parsed or it would find nothing. #}
<script defer src="https://babook.co.il/counter/c.js" data-site="c6b824abd1"></script>
